---
const strengthTags = ['SEO / Growth', 'Performance', 'Platform / Admin', 'Infra / Observability', 'Leadership'];
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 mb-6" data-reveal="up">
      Work
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-8" data-reveal="up" data-reveal-delay="100">
      단순 UI 구현을 넘어, 서비스 성장과 운영 효율까지 연결하는 문제 해결에 집중해 왔습니다.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-reveal="up" data-reveal-delay="200">
      {strengthTags.map((tag) => (
        <span class="text-sm px-3 py-1.5 bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 rounded-full">{tag}</span>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
